Changes in version 1.9.7: Fixed a few things and removed the bold versions with icons. I don't think many people will use those.
Also put back the multiply symbol in the icon versions and moved that glyph to the empty space at 00A0.
Everything should work now.

Changes in version 1.9.8: Fixed a couple things I missed last time and completed as much of the bold as I could.

Changes in version 1.9.9: Added a consolefont for terminusmodx.
